' Spike sample: an unclosed alt and a typo'd participant on purpose.
@startuml theme-switch
title Switching the Omarchy theme

actor User
participant "Omarchy menu" as Menu
participant Hyprland #e68e0d
database "~/.local/state/omarchy" as State

/' Everything below reacts to
   the new colors.toml '/
User -> Menu : Super+Ctrl+Shift+Space
Menu -> State : omarchy-theme-set tokyo-night
activate State
State --> Hyprland : reload colors
note right of Hyprland
  Borders, bar and
  terminals follow.
end note

alt Omagram is running
  State -> Omagram : colors.toml changed
  Omagram -> Omagram : restyle editor
else not running
  User -> hyprland : nothing to do
deactivate State

== Done ==
...
User <-- Menu : theme applied
@enduml
